{
  "$schema": "is-preview/v1",
  "tag": "is-component-diagram",
  "category": "diagrams",
  "title": "<is-component-diagram>",
  "titleHtml": true,
  "storageKey": "docs-is-component-diagram",
  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "intro",
      "title": "<is-component-diagram>",
      "lede": "Diagrama de componentes UML en SVG, sin Mermaid: paquetes, componentes con estereotipo e interfaces provided/required.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": "<p>El empaque dispersa las cajas. Ajusta la distancia mínima con <code>min-gap</code> (px) o con <code>layout.minGap</code> en el JSON. Valores por eje: <code>rowGap</code>, <code>colGutter</code>, <code>pkgCorridor</code>.</p>"
        },
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": "<is-component-diagram min-gap=\"64\" open-on-click>\n  <script type=\"application/json\">\n    {\n      \"componentDiagram\": {\n        \"title\": \"Servicio de voz\",\n        \"packages\": [\n          { \"id\": \"pkg-api\", \"label\": \"API\", \"hue\": 210, \"x\": 36, \"y\": 56, \"w\": 540, \"h\": 220 }\n        ],\n        \"components\": [\n          { \"id\": \"gw\", \"label\": \"Gateway\", \"stereotype\": \"worker\", \"hue\": 210, \"x\": 56, \"y\": 100, \"w\": 140, \"h\": 56 },\n          { \"id\": \"sess\", \"label\": \"Sesion\", \"stereotype\": \"module\", \"hue\": 210, \"x\": 300, \"y\": 100, \"w\": 140, \"h\": 56 },\n          { \"id\": \"db\", \"label\": \"D1\", \"stereotype\": \"db\", \"hue\": 150, \"x\": 300, \"y\": 188, \"w\": 140, \"h\": 50 }\n        ],\n        \"links\": [\n          { \"from\": \"gw\", \"to\": \"sess\" },\n          { \"from\": \"sess\", \"to\": \"db\" }\n        ]\n      }\n    }\n  </script>\n</is-component-diagram>",
          "controls": [
            {
              "control": "number",
              "prop": "attr:min-gap",
              "label": "min-gap",
              "min": 0,
              "max": 100,
              "step": 1
            },
            {
              "control": "boolean",
              "prop": "attr:open-on-click",
              "label": "open-on-click"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
